# Nixpacks cache-mounts /app/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo during the Dokploy build, and
# a BuildKit cache mount is always a directory. Commit this artifact and COPY
# lands a regular file there first, so runc fails with "not a directory".
# apps/landing ignores it for the same reason.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
